WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.691 Tennis already gives you enough to think about. TenAceIQ helps make the next decision a whole lot clearer.
00:00:06.281 --> 00:00:13.693 You can start free, then choose the tools that fit your tennis life: Player, Coach, Captain, League, Full-Court, or Club.
00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:20.304 Need an answer? Explore players, teams, leagues, rankings, and tournaments in one place.
00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:28.506 When it is your game, Player brings everything together in My Lab, with matchup prep, Level Up, and tactics tools built around you.
00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:36.353 If you are coaching, plan the lesson, assign the next piece of work, review progress, and keep every player moving between sessions.
00:00:36.943 --> 00:00:43.700 Captaining a team? See who is ready, compare lineups, scout the matchup, and send one plan everyone understands.
00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:51.920 Running a league or tournament? Manage schedules, scores, standings, and events without turning every update into spreadsheet cleanup.
00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:58.349 Wearing more than one hat? Full-Court keeps your player, coach, captain, and organizer tools connected.
00:00:58.939 --> 00:01:06.614 Running a club? Bring staff, players, programs, teams, leagues, and tournaments into one branded, connected experience.
00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:17.434 And when members share trusted uploads, Data Assist keeps results, rosters, and schedules current. Every contribution makes TenAceIQ more useful for the entire tennis community.
00:01:18.024 --> 00:01:24.018 Start free. Add only what helps. TenAceIQ. More tennis. Less chaos.
